## Triggers

| Trigger Phrase | Operation |
|----------------|-----------|
| `run the planner workflow` | planner.py (planning phase) |
| `review the plan file at plans/X.md` | planner.py (review phase) |
| `pick up where the plan left off` | executor.py (reconcile, then continue) |
